{"comment_text": {"ja22:0.1": "", "ja22:0.2": "", "ja22:0.3": "", "ja22:0.4": "", "ja22:1.1": "The Bodhisatta, born as a leader of a pack of dogs in the cemetery (!), protests the unjust slaughter of the wild dogs when it is the fancy hounds of the court who are the real culprits. ", "ja22:1.2": "For <i lang='pi' translate='no'>koleyyakā</i> see <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an7.63/en/sujato#10.3'>AN 7.63:10.3</a>. ", "ja22:1.3": "", "ja22:1.4": "", "ja22:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja22:0.1": "<article id='ja22'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja22:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja22:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja22:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja22:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja22:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja22:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja22:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja22:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja22:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja22:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja22:0.3": "Kuruṅgavagga ", "ja22:0.4": "2. Kukkurajātaka ", "ja22:1.1": "“Ye kukkurā rājakulamhi vaddhā, ", "ja22:1.2": "Koleyyakā vaṇṇabalūpapannā; ", "ja22:1.3": "Teme na vajjhā mayamasma vajjhā, ", "ja22:1.4": "Nāyaṁ saghaccā dubbalaghātikāyan”ti. ", "ja22:2.1": "Kukkurajātakaṁ dutiyaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja22:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 22 ", "ja22:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja22:0.3": "The Four-horned Antelope ", "ja22:0.4": "Hounds: a past life story ", "ja22:1.1": "The dogs raised in the royal family, ", "ja22:1.2": "pedigreed, handsome and strong, ", "ja22:1.3": "are not slaughtered, we are slaughtered—", "ja22:1.4": "this is not the mutts deserving death, <j>this is the killing of the weak. ", "ja22:2.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja22:0.1": "", "ja22:0.2": "", "ja22:0.3": "", "ja22:0.4": "", "ja22:1.1": "ms22J_48, msdiv22, pts-vp-pli1.177", "ja22:1.2": "", "ja22:1.3": "", "ja22:1.4": "", "ja22:2.1": "ms22J_49"}, "keys_order": ["ja22:0.1", "ja22:0.2", "ja22:0.3", "ja22:0.4", "ja22:1.1", "ja22:1.2", "ja22:1.3", "ja22:1.4", "ja22:2.1"]}